WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Alright,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.000
a word analogy!

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.433
Finger is to hand,

00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:14.833
as toe is to...

00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:15.433
what?

00:00:15.433 --> 00:00:16.033
A.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:16.667
Leg,

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:17.267
B.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:17.867
Shoe,

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:18.467
C.

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:19.067
Foot,

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:20.267
or D.

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:20.867
Nail?

00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:22.067
Five seconds!

00:00:27.867 --> 00:00:29.067
TIME'S UP!

00:00:29.733 --> 00:00:30.100
It's...

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:30.433
C,

00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:30.800
foot!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.933
A finger is part of a

00:00:32.933 --> 00:00:33.300
hand,

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.433
so a toe is part of

00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:36.167
a foot.

00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:38.300
It is the whole that the

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.733
small part belongs to.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:41.500
Okay,

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.233
a picture puzzle!

00:00:43.233 --> 00:00:46.767
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:47.367
A.

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:47.933
Top-left,

00:00:47.933 --> 00:00:48.533
B.

00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:49.100
Top-right,

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:49.700
C.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:50.300
Center,

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.467
or D.

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:52.033
Bottom-left?

00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:53.233
Five seconds!

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.200
TIME'S UP!

00:01:00.867 --> 00:01:02.433
The answer is...

00:01:02.433 --> 00:01:02.933
A,

00:01:02.933 --> 00:01:03.467
top-left!

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:06.033
The dot steps clockwise corner

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:07.100
to corner:

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:07.600
top-right,

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.133
bottom-right,

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:08.633
bottom-left,

00:01:08.633 --> 00:01:11.733
so the next corner is top-left.

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:13.467
Alright,

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:15.200
a number analogy!

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.933
One makes three,

00:01:16.933 --> 00:01:18.667
two makes six,

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:20.400
three makes nine,

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.133
so four makes...

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:22.700
what?

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:23.300
A.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:23.867
Seven,

00:01:23.867 --> 00:01:24.433
B.

00:01:24.433 --> 00:01:25.033
Twelve,

00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:25.600
C.

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:26.167
Ten,

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:27.333
or D.

00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:27.900
Fifteen?

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:29.067
Five seconds!

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:36.033
TIME'S UP!

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:37.200
It's...

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:37.700
B,

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:38.200
twelve!

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.167
Each number is multiplied by three:

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:43.667
four times three is twelve.

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:45.200
So,

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.233
are you smart or fart?

00:01:47.233 --> 00:01:49.667
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:50.867
find your rank!

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:52.367
So,

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:53.767
how did you do?

00:01:53.767 --> 00:01:55.133
Comment your score below,

00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:56.500
and follow for more!
